  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> are two statements, then <math><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>&#8764;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equivalent to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know that <math><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>≡</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></math><br /><br />Hence <math><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∼</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo></math><math><mi>&nbsp;p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∼</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />as we know that <math><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></br></br>Hence <math><mi>&nbsp;p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∼</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Therefore <math><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mi>p</mi></math>"
  }
